- **Arduino core for ESP32** — LGPL-2.1 (Arduino), Apache-2.0 (ESP-IDF)
- **ESP-IDF / NimBLE / Network Provisioning** — Apache-2.0
- **ArduinoJson** — MIT

These are downloaded by PlatformIO into `.pio/` at build time and are not
redistributed in this repository.

